                <span class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</span>
                <h2>Why Meal Share was built</h2>
                <p>
                    Every day we see large amounts of perfectly edible food being thrown away,
                    while many people nearby still struggle to get a proper meal. That gap is
                    rarely about a lack of food — it's about coordination.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Meal Share was built to close that gap. It gives donors, delivery agents,
                    and administrators one shared platform to work from — with clear roles, a
                    verification step, and visibility into where every donation stands, from the
                    moment it's offered to the moment it reaches someone in need.
                </p>

